  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin, if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64feb2140b237e7ffbabcba3-b8d6259a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thickly slice carrot into rounds.\n• Thinly slice brown onion. Set aside.\n• Roughly chop roasted almonds. Set aside.\n• Place snacking tomatoes and carrot on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until blistered, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64feb2140b237e7ffbabcba3-b3073b81.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a medium saucepan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring regularly, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the balsamic vinegar, the brown sugar and a splash of water. Mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64feb2140b237e7ffbabcba3-938d9e4e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan with the caramelised onion, add a drizzle of olive oil and the pearl couscous.\n• Toast pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, until golden, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water and vegetable stock powder. Bring to the boil, then simmer, uncovered, until couscous tender and water is absorbed, 10-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64feb2140b237e7ffbabcba3-cffd7156.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the couscous is ready, add roasted tomatoes, carrot and baby spinach leaves to the pan.\n• Stir to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64feb2140b237e7ffbabcba3-83a417bf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie pearl couscous between bowls. Top with garlicky roast pumpkin.\n• Drizzle with plant-based basil pesto and sprinkle with chopped almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64feb2140b237e7ffbabcba3-040ff4f3.jpeg"
    }
  ]
